{
  "info": {
    "name": "V52 Tier3 Team 34 API",
    "description": "Complete API testing suite for the Live Music Finder application.\n\n## Collections\n- Authentication API: User authentication and authorization\n- Events API: Event management and discovery\n- Users API: User profile and management\n- Venues API: Venue management and discovery\n\n## Environment Setup\n- Local: http://localhost:3000/api/v1\n- Production: https://v52-tier3-team-34.onrender.com/api/v1",
